======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 192 - Capstone 2: Event-Driven Order Platform
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Direct HTTP calls from order handler to payment, inventory, and notification services.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Orders API + SQLite WAL transaction + Outbox poller + Worker queue dispatch.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
